{"seq":80,"slug":"frontend-micro-frontends","title":"微前端架构","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"微前端架构\">微前端架构</h1><p>当一个前端产品的开发团队扩展到三个以上、各自需要独立的发布节奏时，传统单体 SPA 的耦合问题会呈指数级放大——构建时间膨胀、发布冲突频发、技术演进被迫全局同步。微前端架构正是为解决这类组织规模化带来的协作瓶颈而诞生的模式。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于微前端的工程实现与运维实践，面向已有单体前端经验的中高级工程师。内容以 2026 年主流方案为锚点——Module Federation 2.0 稳定版、Single-SPA 6.x 生态、qiankun/wujie/micro-app 三大国产框架，以及 Web Components 与边缘组合等新兴模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本仓库存在多个与微前端相关的 hub，职责边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本 hub（80_frontend-micro-frontends）</strong>：系统性地覆盖微前端的架构设计、主流框架实现、工程化与运维实践。深度优先，内容以 2026 年技术现状为基准。</li>\n<li><strong>32_build-tooling-bundlers</strong>：聚焦构建工具本身（Webpack/Vite/Rspack 内部机制、Code Splitting、Tree Shaking）。Module Federation 的构建配置细节会在本 hub 展开，但底层打包原理请参考该 hub。</li>\n<li><strong>77_design-systems</strong>：覆盖跨团队共享设计系统的组件分发与治理。微前端场景下的设计系统共享策略会在本 hub 的工程化章节讨论，但 Token 体系与组件 API 设计请参考该 hub。</li>\n<li><strong>21_frontend-architecture-patterns</strong>：讲解通用前端架构模式（分层、特性模块、DDD 在前端的映射）。本 hub 的基础章节会引用其中的架构决策框架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于不同背景的读者，建议按以下顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>从零了解微前端</strong>：基础篇（第 1 章）→ 实现篇 Module Federation（第 2 章第 1 节）→ 工程篇共享依赖（第 3 章第 1 节）→ 运维篇迁移策略（第 4 章第 3 节）</li>\n<li><strong>已有微前端经验、想升级到 MF 2.0</strong>：实现篇全部（第 2 章）→ 工程篇构建部署（第 3 章第 2 节）→ 运维篇性能优化（第 4 章第 1 节）</li>\n<li><strong>架构师做技术选型</strong>：基础篇架构模式（第 1 章第 1 节）→ 实现篇三篇对比阅读 → 运维篇迁移策略（第 4 章第 3 节）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>至少一个主流前端框架（React/Vue/Angular）的项目经验</li>\n<li>对 Webpack 或 Vite 的配置有基本认知</li>\n<li>了解 ES Module 的 import/export 机制</li>\n<li>对 monorepo 概念有基本了解（推荐先阅读 <a href=\"../build-tooling-bundlers/engineering/monorepo-build\">构建工具 hub 的 monorepo 构建篇</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-patterns","title":"微前端架构模式与适用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/architecture-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"isolation-sandbox","title":"隔离与沙箱机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/isolation-sandbox"},{"seq":3,"slug":"routing-communication","title":"路由协调与跨应用通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/routing-communication"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实现篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 2.0 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/module-federation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"single-spa-framework","title":"Single-SPA 与运行时编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/single-spa-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"web-components-approach","title":"Web Components 与边缘组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/web-components-approach"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-dependencies","title":"共享依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/shared-dependencies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-deploy-pipeline","title":"构建与部署流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/build-deploy-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-quality","title":"测试与质量保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/testing-quality"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/performance-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-debugging","title":"监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/monitoring-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/migration-strategy"}]}]}